data: {"id": "2619d4429bae40b5-thinking-parallel_evidence-2319", "run_id": "2619d4429bae40b5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经获取了关键证据。让我总结一下已采集的事实：\n\n## 已采集证据总结\n\n### 1. Pod 状态（kubectl_describe）\n- **状态**: Pending\n- **节点**: <none>（未调度）\n- **关键事件**: \n  - `FailedScheduling`: \"0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.\"\n  - 事件发生在 27 分钟前和 17 分钟前（x2）\n\n### 2. Pod YAML 配置（kubectl_get_yaml）\n- **Phase**: Pending\n- **PodScheduled**: False，原因：Unschedulable\n- **容器资源请求**:\n  - CPU: **未设置 requests**（注意：YAML 中只显示了 limits 和 requests 的部分）\n  - Memory ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789106166367, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

