data: {"id": "2619d4429bae40b5-final", "run_id": "2619d4429bae40b5", "seq": 2324, "ts_ms": 1789106184466, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | aiops-case-v01/workload处于Pending状态，无法调度。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod `aiops-case-v01/workload` (fact-552add6e4869, fact-d34e2aa8eb54) | `status: Pending`, `phase: Pending` | 确认工作负载处于不可调度的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | default-scheduler (fact-2c6d808a949a) | `FailedScheduling`: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu` (发生2次) | 直接指明调度失败原因为节点 CPU 资源不足 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Pod Condition (fact-6b34526ae6ee) | `PodScheduled=False`, `Unschedulable`: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu` (2026-09-11T05:28:07Z) | 提供调度失败的具体时间戳和系统判断依据 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Resource Request (fact-4fd8ee1b14c1) | `container.resource_request.cpu: 100k` | 定义该 Pod 对 CPU 资源的硬性调度需求（100 millicores） |\n| 5 | K8s Config | Resource Limit (fact-0178ab468b77) | `container.resource_limit.cpu: 100k` | 确认 CPU 硬限制与请求量一致 |\n| 6 | Metric | kube-state-metrics (fact-01abff560495) | `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (labels: phase=\"Pending\", sample_count=1) | 确认集群监控中存在且仅存在一个处于 Pending 状态的 Pod |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n事件（#2）与调度条件（#3）相互印证，确认集群中全部 3 个节点均无法满足该 Pod 对 100k CPU 的调度请求，且不存在抢占 victim。指标（#6）进一步从监控维度佐证了该 Pod 的停滞状态持续存在。由于容器始终未能调度启动，Logging 与 Tracing 维度物理上不可用，诊断完全基于 K8s 调度状态与配置。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n集群所有3个节点（master, node1, node2）的可用CPU < 100k (fact-4fd8ee1b14c1)\n  → Scheduler 无法匹配任何节点满足 CPU request\n    → 触发 FailedScheduling 事件，Pod 持续保持 Pending 状态 (fact-2c6d808a949a)\n      → 用户可见 workload 无法调度启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：集群节点 CPU 资源不足（Insufficient cpu）且无抢占资源可用。**\n\n该根因由 K8s Event `FailedScheduling` (fact-2c6d808a949a) 与 Pod Condition `Unschedulable` (fact-6b34526ae6ee) 确凿支撑。事实明确显示，集群全部 3 个节点均无法满足 Pod 对 `100k` CPU 的调度请求，且调度器未找到任何用于抢占的资源（`No preemption victims found`）。\n\n**证据充分性说明：**\n现有证据完整覆盖了从调度失败原因（CPU 不足）到最终现象（Pending 状态）的闭环，无需 Logging 或 Tracing 数据即可下结论。RCA 事实绑定正确，证据不足判定不适用。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 39.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 30.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v01/workload: 30.2s (Evidence 24.1s, RCA 6.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v01/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 81.837, "metrics": {"run_id": "2619d4429bae40b5", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 81.84376788139343, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 81843.76788139343, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 78456.23302459717, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7845.266342163086, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3074.143409729004}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 39646.028995513916, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 30218.859910964966, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11957.617282867432, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

